# Godot regenerates .import sidecars with LF line endings every reimport
# regardless of platform. Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows keeps
# flipping them to CRLF on checkout, so every regenerated file shows as
# modified with a 0-line diff (pure line-ending churn, no real change) -
# see UNIFIED_ROADMAP.md 0.7/0.8.
*.import text eol=lf
